1
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,640
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,710
=Episode 22=

3
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:15,720
(Are you here to mock me?)

4
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,240
Princess, you're gifted at painting.

5
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,200
Her Highness speaks highly of you, too.

6
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,720
She went out of her way to find

7
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:34,120
these fine wolf-hair brushes
and Hui ink for you.

8
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,440
You're her maid.

9
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,720
Of course you'd defend her.

10
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,800
She killed my mother back then.

11
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,880
Now she's nice to me

12
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,560
only because she has no daughter,

13
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:42,760
no one to rely on later.

14
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:43,880
What a hypocrite.

15
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,800
Who taught you to say that?

16
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,400
Princess, please take it.

17
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:49,640
Jinxuan.

18
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,120
She's just a servant.

19
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:54,360
What's wrong with pushing her?

20
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,320
Thank you, Your Highness.

21
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:56,160
A servant?

22
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,320
Is that how

23
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,440
I've taught you to behave?

24
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:00,760
Apologize. Now.

25
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:01,720
Apologize?

26
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:03,440
Why should a princess

27
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,640
apologize to a servant?

28
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,000
Fine.

29
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,280
If you refuse to apologize,

30
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:11,000
go stand over there.

31
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,440
When you've learned your lesson,

32
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:13,560
come back and apologize.

33
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:21,560
Your Highness.

34
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,640
New tribute goods have arrived
at the Imperial Household.

35
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,040
Please have a review.

36
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,200
All right.

37
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:30,000
Chunli.

38
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:31,400
Keep an eye on her.

39
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,360
No leaving until she apologizes.

40
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:35,960
She's been spoiled and unruly lately.

41
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,160
Let her learn some discipline.

42
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,640
Yes, Your Highness.

43
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,240
Princess, it's raining.

44
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,160
Please come back with me.

45
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:59,400
Princess!

46
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,560
I'm begging you,

47
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,560
come back inside.

48
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:04,000
You'll catch a chill.

49
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:05,960
Princess...

50
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,320
Leave me alone!

51
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,280
No...

52
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:24,200
Princess!

53
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,160
Princess!

54
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:28,640
Princess!

55
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,400
Let's go, Princess.

56
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,800
She's burning up.

57
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,240
Your Highness.

58
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:53,000
Director Li is here.

59
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,520
Physician Li, hurry!

60
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,120
Take a look.

61
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:57,440
Yes.

62
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,360
Your Highness.

63
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,040
The princess has caught a chill.

64
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:13,920
Nothing serious.

65
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:15,080
I'll write a prescription.

66
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,080
Take it on time,

67
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,840
she should recover in a few days.

68
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,680
Thank you, Director Li.

69
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,160
Mother...

70
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,400
Mother.

71
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,200
Mother...

72
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:41,400
I'm here.

73
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:42,440
Mother...

74
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,400
I'm here.

75
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,200
Mother...

76
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,600
Good.

77
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,480
Fortune is on my side.

78
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,080
Where's Yucui?

79
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,280
Yucui!

80
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:08,840
Your Highness.

81
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,000
Yucui.

82
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:17,640
I hear you've just been
transferred to Jinghe Palace.

83
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:19,800
You're now Princess Jinxuan's
personal maid?

84
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:20,920
Yes, Your Highness.

85
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,400
As I recall,

86
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,360
your mother

87
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,440
had an affair with a guard and bore you.

88
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,400
By palace rules,

89
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,880
you should've been sent to
the Imperial Laundry

90
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,320
to toil there for life,

91
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:32,080
with no hope of rising.

92
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,920
But I took pity on you.

93
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,320
I chose you early

94
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,840
and placed you in the Jinghe Palace.

95
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:37,760
Now,

96
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,840
it's time to repay me.

97
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,480
I'll never forget

98
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,040
Your Highness saving my life.

99
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,680
You gave me a better life.

100
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,960
I'll serve you with all my heart,

101
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,080
even at the cost of my life.

102
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:03,240
Princess Jinxuan of Jinghe Palace
has had a persistent high fever.

103
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,760
I want you to add some

104
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,480
minced fish and shrimp to her food.

105
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,400
She's weak from illness.

106
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,440
Once she eats these irritants,

107
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,720
her fever will rage,

108
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,360
and she won't heal.

109
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,360
Yes.

110
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,120
I'll see to it, Your Highness.

111
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,480
Yinshuang.

112
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:24,680
I'm going to see His Majesty.

113
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:27,200
I'll accuse Fu Rong of
neglecting her duties

114
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,280
and being unfit to raise the princess.

115
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:32,080
Then I can take Jinxuan from her

116
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,920
and secure a future

117
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:36,280
for my Xihe early.

118
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,360
Yes.

119
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,160
Physician Wang.

120
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,920
It's been days already.

121
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:47,920
Why isn't she getting any better?

122
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,080
She's getting worse.

123
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,800
Director Li came yesterday,

124
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,240
and now Physician Wang's here.

125
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,320
Her fever should've gone down by now.

126
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,320
His Majesty has arrived.

127
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,720
Consort Qi has arrived.

128
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,120
Your Majesty.

129
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,880
Why hasn't the princess recovered?

130
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:05,880
Your Majesty.

131
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:06,920
The princess caught a chill,

132
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,880
but she hasn't recovered.

133
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,480
I examined the medicine carefully.

134
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:10,640
Nothing unusual.

135
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,040
Perhaps she's frail

136
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:12,960
and troubled in mind,

137
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,120
causing her illness to recur.

138
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,040
Your Majesty.

139
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:16,720
The princess has always been pampered.

140
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,800
Her cough had just cleared up,

141
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,920
then she was made to
stand in the rain two days ago.

142
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,600
No wonder she hasn't recovered.

143
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,160
Not her own daughter,

144
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:24,720
so of course she doesn't really care.

145
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:25,480
Consort...

146
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,360
Stand as punishment?

147
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:27,720
What happened?

148
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,200
Your Majesty.

149
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,520
A few days ago,

150
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:33,120
Jinxuan took her anger out
on a servant for no reason.

151
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,040
I made her stand as punishment

152
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:37,400
until she admitted her mistake.

153
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,200
But Jinxuan is stubborn.

154
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,880
She wouldn't leave even in the rain.

155
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,760
That's how she caught a chill.

156
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:43,720
Your Majesty.

157
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,960
Rumors are flying all over the harem.

158
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,600
People in Jinghe Palace often say

159
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:49,120
Consort Rong mistreats Jinxuan.

160
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,480
If you don't believe it,

161
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,960
just summon them and ask.

162
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:52,880
Summon them.

163
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:53,680
Yes.

164
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,200
Before His Majesty,

165
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:04,600
you must speak the truth.

166
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:05,920
Don't be afraid.

167
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,200
His Majesty is here.

168
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:08,800
No one will dare harm you.

169
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,680
Your Majesty.

170
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:13,840
I'm a maid of the Jinghe Palace.

171
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,840
At the banquet,

172
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:17,120
Consort Rong wouldn't let the princess
drink the sweet fermented rice.

173
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,480
Back at the palace that night,

174
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:20,440
Consort Rong wouldn't let her eat.

175
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:21,800
She even knocked over her food.

176
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,480
They argued in the room.

177
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,320
Her Highness was furious.

178
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:27,200
The princess was frightened to tears.

179
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,240
Your Majesty.

180
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,480
I saw it too.

181
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,800
Days ago, the princess
knocked over an inkstone.

182
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,560
Her Highness made her

183
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:36,040
kneel in the study
for two to four hours.

184
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:37,760
Her knees were badly bruised.

185
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:40,640
Princess Jinxuan mentioned
Zhaoyi Shen's death.

186
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,040
Her Highness and the princess

187
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:43,400
had a terrible argument.

188
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,160
Consort Rong.

189
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:47,440
Even if you and Zhaoyi Shen had a feud,

190
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:50,040
how could you take the hatred
between adults

191
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,720
out on a child?

192
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:54,000
Jinxuan is Zhaoyi Shen's daughter.

193
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,240
Are you mistreating her because of

194
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,640
your old grudge against Zhaoyi Shen?

195
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:58,760
Don't forget,

196
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,920
she's my daughter, too!

197
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,440
You misunderstand, Your Majesty.

198
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,440
I didn't do that.

199
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,040
When she knocked over the inkstone,

200
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,520
I told her to clean it up.

201
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:08,080
She hid in her room
and wouldn't come out.

202
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,400
Then she climbed out the window

203
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,080
and fell, bruising her knees.

204
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:13,840
As for the sweet fermented rice,
her cough wasn't healed,

205
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:14,760
so she couldn't have it.

206
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:15,840
Your Majesty.

207
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:16,920
She's still a child.

208
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,760
She needs guidance.

209
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,480
We can't indulge her all the time.

210
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,360
You still make excuses!

211
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:21,920
These maids

212
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,600
are all from your own palace.

213
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,640
Are you saying

214
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,880
they're all lying?

215
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:27,760
I don't know why they'd say this.

216
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,280
Nor do I know

217
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,320
if someone put them up to it.

218
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:34,840
Your Majesty.

219
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,880
I can't bear to see Jinxuan mistreated.

220
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,360
If you trust me,

221
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:41,800
I'll care for Princess Jinxuan for now.

222
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,080
Once she recovers,

223
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,760
I'll send her back to Consort Rong.

224
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:46,720
Consort Rong.

225
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,320
It seems you really aren't fit
to care for Jinxuan.

226
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:51,520
The whole palace is talking.

227
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:53,280
You've sorely disappointed me.

228
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:55,680
As of today,

229
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,200
Jinxuan will be

230
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,760
moved to the Zhongning Palace.

231
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:00,800
Concubine Qi.

232
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,720
I entrust the princess to you.

233
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:04,600
You should raise her as carefully

234
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:05,800
as you do Xihe.

235
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:07,640
I obey, Your Majesty.

236
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,920
I'll do my utmost

237
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,480
and treat Jinxuan as my own,

238
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,880
and honor Your Majesty's trust.

239
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:22,200
(Zhongning Palace)

240
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:29,360
Your Highness.

241
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,640
Please take a rest.

242
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,800
Let me do it.

243
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:34,120
I'll do it myself.

244
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,240
It's just a common chill.

245
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:38,280
She ate some fish and shrimp,

246
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,000
which aggravated the fever

247
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,040
and made her illness recur.

248
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,720
With normal food

249
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,680
and her medicine,

250
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,160
she'll soon recover.

251
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:49,760
I'll make sure she grows nice and plump.

252
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:51,880
Then one day,

253
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:54,360
she can be married off to the frontier
in Xihe's place.

254
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,080
Congratulations, Your Highness.

255
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:57,960
With this move,

256
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,160
you've cost Consort Rong
His Majesty's trust

257
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:02,600
and kept Princess Xihe by your side.

258
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,320
Two birds with one stone.

259
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:31,960
Guards!

260
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:32,880
Fetch the physician!

261
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:37,920
Hurry!

262
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,400
Your Highness.

263
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,840
The princess's pulse is erratic,

264
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,680
and her breathing is weak.

265
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:52,800
Her condition is complicated.

266
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:54,280
I'm afraid I'm unable to help.

267
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:55,440
Physician Wang.

268
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,240
You must save Jinxuan!

269
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,360
You must cure her!

270
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:58,960
Your Highness.

271
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,360
I'm truly at a loss.

272
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:02,600
Allow me to consult my colleagues.

273
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,560
Consult?

274
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,440
By the time you fools finish consulting,

275
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,440
it'll be too late!

276
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:07,360
Your Highness...

277
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:16,200
Xihe.

278
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:17,360
Don't be afraid.

279
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:18,640
Mother's here.

280
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:23,320
(I'll never let you be sent off
to marry for an alliance.)

281
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,440
(Never.)

282
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,080
(Xihe.)

283
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:28,440
(I can't lose you too.)

284
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:43,920
It's been two days.

285
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,720
Why hasn't the princess recovered?

286
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:47,440
Your Highness.

287
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:48,840
Her illness is unusual.

288
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:49,960
We've studied ancient texts

289
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:50,720
and medical records,

290
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:51,760
but found no match.

291
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:52,720
We are

292
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,360
truly at a loss.

293
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,880
His Majesty has arrived.

294
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,200
How is Jinxuan?

295
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,840
I've failed you, Your Majesty.

296
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,000
Her condition suddenly worsened.

297
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:11,000
The physicians are doing all they can.

298
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:12,840
Your Majesty.

299
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,720
The princess's illness is strange.

300
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:15,880
Her pulse is erratic,

301
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:16,800
symptoms complex.

302
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,400
We've deliberated again and again

303
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,800
but can't find the cause.

304
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:22,040
Her previous cold has not yet cleared.

305
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,320
Her vital energy is depleted.

306
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,240
Symptoms compound,

307
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,720
and her condition has worsened.

308
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:27,360
Director Li.

309
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:29,760
How is Jinxuan's condition?

310
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:32,720
Your Majesty.

311
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:35,040
Her condition is indeed complicated.

312
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,040
But rest assured,

313
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:37,960
we will do our utmost to treat her.

314
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:39,520
But her vitality is badly damaged

315
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,240
and her lungs harmed.

316
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:42,280
She may need months of rest
before she can get up.

317
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:43,800
Whatever it takes,

318
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:45,480
you must save the princess.

319
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,400
No mistakes.

320
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:48,200
Yes, Your Majesty.

321
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:59,040
You volunteered to raise Jinxuan.

322
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:00,920
You should do your utmost.

323
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:02,680
You promised so confidently

324
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:04,680
that you'd cure her and raise her well.

325
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:06,240
Now in your care,

326
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:08,040
she's only gotten worse.

327
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:09,560
I deserve punishment.

328
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:13,240
I also came today to tell you something.

329
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:15,800
Last night, the envoys from Beijie

330
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,400
pressed again
about the marriage alliance.

331
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:20,320
Now that Princess Jinxuan is bedridden,

332
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:22,480
Princess Xihe is the best choice.

333
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:24,640
I've decided

334
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:26,640
to send Xihe to Beijie
for a marriage alliance.

335
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,520
Your Majesty.

336
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:30,800
Xihe is still so young...

337
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,000
Concubine Qi.

338
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,760
Don't you understand?

339
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,680
The princesses enjoy
royal wealth and glory,

340
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,040
fine clothes and rich food,

341
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,560
all provided by the people.

342
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:41,640
In return,

343
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,840
they must fulfill their royal duties

344
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,360
and shoulder the nation's burdens.

345
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:46,920
This matter

346
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:49,000
is not up for discussion.

347
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:50,560
My decision is final.

348
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:51,960
Your...

349
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,360
Mother.

350
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,920
I don't want to be married away!

351
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:01,440
I don't want to leave you.

352
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:04,480
I don't want to leave, Mother!

353
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,200
You won't.

354
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,480
I won't let you be sent away.

355
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,040
I won't.

356
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:14,800
Fu Rong.

357
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:16,440
What are you doing here?

358
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:18,640
Are you here to mock me?

359
00:14:18,800 --> 00:14:20,240
I heard Jinxuan was gravely ill.

360
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,920
I've come to see her.

361
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:24,360
Didn't you confidently promise

362
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:26,160
that you'd take good care of her?

363
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,560
You schemed and plotted

364
00:14:28,560 --> 00:14:30,040
to take her away from me,

365
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:32,040
just so she'd marry away

366
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:34,920
in your daughter's place?

367
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:38,920
Did you really think
I wouldn't see through it?

368
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,640
How did you know?

369
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:46,880
You knew all along His Majesty would
choose a princess for the alliance.

370
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,280
Jinxuan's illness...

371
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:50,200
You caused it, didn't you?

372
00:14:53,875 --> 00:14:58,515
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

373
00:14:58,885 --> 00:15:03,365
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

374
00:15:03,795 --> 00:15:08,075
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

375
00:15:08,515 --> 00:15:12,995
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

376
00:15:13,435 --> 00:15:17,755
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

377
00:15:18,335 --> 00:15:22,795
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

378
00:15:23,135 --> 00:15:27,595
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

379
00:15:28,015 --> 00:15:32,515
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

380
00:15:32,805 --> 00:15:37,275
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

381
00:15:37,855 --> 00:15:40,800
♪Let the stars and sea♪

382
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:42,200
(Changsheng Gate)

383
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:46,765
♪Wait for your return♪
